## 6. Mobile Booking Forms

### General Rules
- Each step/field takes full viewport width
- Labels: 13px uppercase, letter-spacing 0.05em
- Inputs: `height: 52px; font-size: 16px` (16px prevents iOS zoom)
- Textarea: `min-height: 100px`
- Date/time pickers: use native `<input type="date">` and `<input type="time">` on mobile for best UX
- Segmented buttons (Car Type, Trip Type): full-width flex row, each option 50% width
- Number steppers (passengers, cars, hours): large minus/plus buttons, minimum 44px tap target
- "Book Now" sticky button: `position: sticky; bottom: 0` within the form scroll container

### Homepage — Service Selector (Mobile)
- 2-column grid of service cards (3 rows × 2 cols)
- Each card: 140px height, service icon (40px) + name
- Tapping a card → Bottom sheet slides up with the booking form

### Form Validation on Mobile
- Errors appear BELOW the field they belong to (inline, red text)
- DO NOT use browser default alert boxes
- On submit with errors → page scrolls to first error field automatically

---

## 7. Mobile Typography & Spacing Overrides

```css
/* mobile.css — Typography */
h1 { font-size: 1.5rem; }       /* 24px */
h2 { font-size: 1.25rem; }      /* 20px */
h3 { font-size: 1.0625rem; }    /* 17px */
p, body { font-size: 0.9375rem; } /* 15px */
small, .label { font-size: 0.8125rem; } /* 13px */
.badge { font-size: 0.75rem; }  /* 12px */

/* mobile.css — Spacing */
.section { padding: 20px 16px; }
.card { padding: 16px; border-radius: 16px; }
.card + .card { margin-top: 12px; }
.page-title { font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px; }
```

---

## 8. Admin Panel Mobile — Specific Rules (admin-mobile.css)

### Dashboard KPI Cards
- Stack vertically (2 per row in a 2-column grid)
- Each card: padding 16px, border-radius 16px, number in 28px bold gold
- Label below number: 12px muted text

### Charts
- Chart 1 (Line): Full width, height 200px
- Chart 2 (Donut): Centered, 200px × 200px with legend below
- Chart 3 (Bar): Full width, height 200px, horizontal scroll if many bars

### Booking Detail (Mobile)
- Single column layout (vs 2-column on desktop)
- Customer info first
- Assignment section second
- Payment section third
- Status progress bar: vertical stepper (vs horizontal on desktop)

### Two-Layer Verification (Mobile)
- Business review: full screen, scroll down to see all document images
- Document images: tap to open full-screen lightbox
- Approve/Reject buttons: fixed at bottom of screen (sticky action bar, 2 buttons side by side)

---

## 9. Animations — Mobile Specific

- Page transitions: slide left (forward) / slide right (back) — 300ms
- Bottom sheet open: translateY(100%) → translateY(0) — 350ms
- Card entrance: fadeInUp staggered — 60ms delay per card
- Status badge: pulse animation on "Ongoing" status — 2s loop (subtle ring)
- Toast notifications: slide in from top — 300ms, auto-dismiss 3s

---

## 10. QA Checklist (Pre-Launch)

### Functional Testing

**Auth**
- [ ] OTP sends within 10 seconds on valid phone
- [ ] OTP expires after 5 minutes
- [ ] 3rd failed OTP attempt locks for 1 hour
- [ ] Login works with both phone+OTP and email+password
- [ ] JWT expires correctly (7 days)

**Booking Flow**
- [ ] All 6 service forms submit with all required fields
- [ ] Submitting with missing required fields shows inline errors
- [ ] Pickup location is always structured (never allows free text input)
- [ ] Seat matching algorithm returns correct combination for 1, 4, 6, 10, 15 passengers
- [ ] Advance payment (SSLCommerz) succeeds and booking status updates
- [ ] bKash manual advance shows "Pending verification" status
- [ ] My Bookings shows correct status badges

**Owner Registration**
- [ ] All 7 steps validate before allowing "Next"
- [ ] OTP verification works on Step 1
- [ ] File uploads work for JPG, PNG, and PDF (each doc slot tested)
- [ ] Files over 5MB are rejected with error message
- [ ] "Add Another Car" correctly duplicates car form
- [ ] Service selection enforces max 3 choices
- [ ] Submission creates DB record with status = pending

**Owner Dashboard**
- [ ] Accept booking → customer gets SMS
- [ ] Reject booking → booking returns to admin pending
- [ ] Start Trip → status updates, timestamp recorded
- [ ] End Trip → commission auto-calculated correctly (10%)
- [ ] Car availability toggle works
- [ ] Earnings calculations are accurate

**Admin Panel**
- [ ] Registration queue loads and filters correctly
- [ ] Approve business → owner gets SMS
- [ ] Reject business with reason → reason delivered via SMS
- [ ] Approve car → car appears in customer search
- [ ] Reject car → does NOT affect other cars under same business
- [ ] Assign driver to booking → status moves to confirmed
- [ ] "Force Complete" admin override works
- [ ] Commission is always auto-calculated (never manually entered)
- [ ] Subscription expiry auto-downgrades visibility

**Security**
- [ ] Customer cannot access `/owner/*` or `/admin/*` routes
- [ ] Owner cannot access `/admin/*` routes
- [ ] Unapproved car returns 0 results in customer car search query
- [ ] Direct file URL access to documents requires auth token

### UI/UX Testing

**Desktop**
- [ ] All buttons have hover states (scale + shadow)
- [ ] All input focus states show accent ring
- [ ] All status badges use correct colors from design system
- [ ] No hardcoded colors anywhere (all use CSS variables)
- [ ] Animations respect `prefers-reduced-motion`
- [ ] No horizontal scrollbar on any page

**Mobile**
- [ ] Bottom nav is visible and tappable on all pages
- [ ] No top navbar visible on mobile
- [ ] All modals are bottom sheets
- [ ] All tables are replaced by cards
- [ ] No horizontal scroll on mobile
- [ ] Input font-size is 16px (no iOS zoom trigger)
- [ ] Touch targets are minimum 44px
- [ ] Admin panel looks and feels like a native app, not a website
- [ ] Back navigation works correctly (OS back button)

**Cross-Browser**
- [ ] Chrome, Safari, Firefox (desktop)
- [ ] Chrome Android, Safari iOS (mobile)
- [ ] Samsung Internet (mobile)
